# Nissa, Who Shakes the World: "Whenever you tap a Forest for mana, add an additional {G}" (CR 605.1b). It is the land that
# is a Forest, not the mana: Breeding Pool (a Forest Island) tapped for {U} on turn 5 adds the extra {G} ({U}{G}), a
# Mountain on turn 3 adds only its {R}, and an opponent's Forest tapped by Bot2 on turn 2 adds nothing extra for either
# player ({G} only, "you tap").

